EN = [
# 3.60: 1장 「마지막에 남는 사람」(우유 → 등불), 「이글루 아래의 지도 제작자」(황금 사과를 건네는 흔적), 숨은 이야기 「안개가 걷힌 저택」(없어진 '오늘의 룬' 언급)
"Dowin the miner? I know that name. It's still on the tavern's tab. He went into the old mine fifteen years ago and never came out. Where those tunnels lead… I don't know. But miners carve words into the timbers. Go and read them. There are spiders down there. Bring plenty of light.",
"Mother had one more companion: Felix the mapmaker. In the margin of the first page it says 'Felix left at the infirmary in the snow.' The cellar under an igloo. Left there… so he was ill. They say someone is locked in down there. The medicine should still be in the infirmary. The gold we have to bring ourselves: one golden apple. Gold is the metal that doesn't forget a name.",
"Find an igloo, examine the infirmary's records, and bring back the one locked in its cellar with 1 golden apple.",
"The One Locked in the Cellar",
"In the corner of the infirmary, behind iron bars, someone sits hunched. The skin is grey. Only the hand around a worn drafting compass will not open.",
"On the lowest shelf one bottle of medicine is left, its wax seal unbroken. The tag: \"Share already paid for. Hand it to whoever comes carrying gold.\"",
"You sprinkle the medicine and push the golden apple through the bars. The grey hand shakes a long while before it takes it. Red steam rises off the skin.",
"After a long time, a hoarse voice. \"…The line is wrong. This room, it is not on the map.\"",
"Hand over the golden apple",
"Archivist Isabel: One lights up each day. Today it's the third mirror. This person has been repeating one letter a day. So as not to forget. For a thousand years.",
]
